<html>
  <head>
    <meta charset='UTF-8' />
    <title>Manuscript Review Update</title>
    <style>
      body {
        font-family: 'Arial', sans-serif;
        background-color: #f4f4f4;
        margin: 0;
        padding: 20px;
      }
      .container {
        background-color: #ffffff;
        padding: 25px;
        border-radius: 8px;
        box-shadow: 0px 0px 10px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
        max-width: 600px;
        margin: auto;
      }
      .header {
        background-color: #d4a017;
        color: white;
        text-align: center;
        padding: 15px;
        border-radius: 8px 8px 0 0;
      }
      .header h2 {
        margin: 0;
        font-size: 20px;
      }
      .content {
        padding: 20px;
        font-size: 16px;
        color: #333;
        line-height: 1.6;
      }
      .content p {
        margin-bottom: 15px;
      }
      .footer {
        text-align: center;
        font-size: 14px;
        color: #777;
        padding-top: 20px;
        border-top: 1px solid #eee;
      }
      .footer a {
        color: #d4a017;
        text-decoration: none;
        font-weight: bold;
      }
      .footer a:hover {
        text-decoration: underline;
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class='container'>
      <div class='header'>
        <h2>Manuscript Review Process Started</h2>
      </div>
      <div class='content'>
        <p>Dear {{authorName}},</p>
        <p>We are pleased to inform you that your manuscript has been assigned
          to reviewers for evaluation.</p>

        <p><strong>Manuscript Title:</strong> {{manuscriptTitle}}</p>
        {{!-- <p><strong>Assigned Reviewers:</strong> {{reviewerNames}}</p> --}}

        {{#if reviewDueDate}}
          <p><strong>Expected Review Completion Date:</strong>
            {{reviewDueDate}}</p>
        {{/if}}

        <p>Our editorial team will notify you once the review process is
          complete.</p>
        <p>If you have any questions, feel free to contact us at
          <a href='mailto:tea@slu.edu.ng'>tea@slu.edu.ng</a>.</p>
        <p>Thank you for choosing <strong>SLUJST</strong>.</p>
        <p>Best Regards,<br /><strong>Editorial Team</strong></p>
      </div>
      <div class='footer'>
        <p>&copy;
          {{year}}
          Sule Lamido University Journal of Science and Technology. All Rights
          Reserved.</p>
        <p>For inquiries, contact
          <a href='mailto:tea@slu.edu.ng'>tea@slu.edu.ng</a></p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>